{"3871960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GRIDROYALE Battle Royale", "steam_appid": 3871960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRIDROYALE is a top-down battle royale shooter game! This is an <strong>offline </strong>battle royale with trained AIs that will put up a fight with even the most talented players! Pick up the game for a few minutes and see if you can really win a match in GRIDROYALE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The most balanced (but fun) lootpool yet!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic weapons are in the lootpool, such as your pistols, snipers, shotguns, rifles, and SMGs. However, you will also find a mobility item: the Hook 'n' Grappler! Alongside these weapons are grenades and placeable traps! All weapons have been considered for balance and gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.poster.avif?t=1777948236\" width=800 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.webm?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.mp4?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A battle royale with... a style meter?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, Gridroyale has a STYLE METER! Upgrade your rank from D Tier to S tier and everything in between to gain health and shield in a match. <i>Bonus</i>: If you're in a Squads/Duos match and you rank up while being knocked, you can revive yourself AND gain a little extra health/shield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.poster.avif?t=1777948236\" width=800 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.webm?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.mp4?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A diverse yet well-thought out map!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The GRIDROYALE map contains many interesting locations. From Dormant Dojo to Tactical Towers, each location offers a new experience. Additionally, a samurai boss will spawn somewhere randomly on the map! Defeat her to get a unique and extremely powerful weapon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/c690f0fcbefca975bb42e6f6f878c0f5.avif?t=1777948236\" width=1600 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and interesting alternate gamemodes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a break from the traditional Battle Royale game mode? Then you can play Rival Revenge: a 20v20 mode where two teams fight to defeat the other, or Endgame Explosions: a mode where your loadout has been randomly chosen before the match even started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/d74e571f61f85a3a67f377ff8a520090.avif?t=1777948236\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras_big/d74e571f61f85a3a67f377ff8a520090.avif?t=1777948236 width=1600 height=1172 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All about accessibility!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very lightweight game in terms of storage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like the default controls of the game? Change them yourself! Also, you can save your progress across multiple accounts with the login system!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRIDROYALE is a top-down battle royale shooter game! This is an <strong>offline </strong>battle royale with trained AIs that will put up a fight with even the most talented players! Pick up the game for a few minutes and see if you can really win a match in GRIDROYALE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The most balanced (but fun) lootpool yet!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic weapons are in the lootpool, such as your pistols, snipers, shotguns, rifles, and SMGs. However, you will also find a mobility item: the Hook 'n' Grappler! Alongside these weapons are grenades and placeable traps! All weapons have been considered for balance and gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.poster.avif?t=1777948236\" width=800 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.webm?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/4409d257bd827c18a299ca1399b36c44.mp4?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A battle royale with... a style meter?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, Gridroyale has a STYLE METER! Upgrade your rank from D Tier to S tier and everything in between to gain health and shield in a match. <i>Bonus</i>: If you're in a Squads/Duos match and you rank up while being knocked, you can revive yourself AND gain a little extra health/shield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.poster.avif?t=1777948236\" width=800 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.webm?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/7f31d8a386e06b17b9ed3d75c6e957dc.mp4?t=1777948236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A diverse yet well-thought out map!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The GRIDROYALE map contains many interesting locations. From Dormant Dojo to Tactical Towers, each location offers a new experience. Additionally, a samurai boss will spawn somewhere randomly on the map! Defeat her to get a unique and extremely powerful weapon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/c690f0fcbefca975bb42e6f6f878c0f5.avif?t=1777948236\" width=1600 height=1172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and interesting alternate gamemodes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a break from the traditional Battle Royale game mode? Then you can play Rival Revenge: a 20v20 mode where two teams fight to defeat the other, or Endgame Explosions: a mode where your loadout has been randomly chosen before the match even started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras/d74e571f61f85a3a67f377ff8a520090.avif?t=1777948236\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/extras_big/d74e571f61f85a3a67f377ff8a520090.avif?t=1777948236 width=1600 height=1172 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All about accessibility!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very lightweight game in terms of storage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like the default controls of the game? Change them yourself! Also, you can save your progress across multiple accounts with the login system!</p>", "short_description": "A top-down battle royale with... a style meter? An offline battle royale? I know you want to try battling with highly trained AIs that will put up a fight with even the most talented players! Customizable characters, a battle pass, challenges, and much more come in this free indie game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/d5544cf4d3d47104f42b9a435290d8a9e5ba4452/header.jpg?t=1777948236", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/9eb3013c51333685fc28cd0c1a3fc8836fe7fff3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777948236", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871960/9eb3013c51333685fc28cd0c1a3fc8836fe7fff3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777948236", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 